  "description": "Características do imóvel:\n\nEste apartamento T2, localiza-se numa sub-cave com luz natural.\n\nEste Imóvel é independente e tem uma entrada privada.\n\nCaracterísticas do imóvel:\n\n- hall de entrada;\n\n- sala ampla;\n\n- casa de banho espaçosa;\n\n- cozinha;\n\n- 2 quartos, com janelas. Um deles com roupeiro embutido;\n\n- terraço e varanda, perfeitos para momentos de lazer ao ar livre.\n\nPrédio: Sub-cave, sem elevador. \n\nCategoria Energética: E\n\nDiscover this 2 bedroom flat, located in a sub-basement with surprising natural light.\n\nProperty features:\n\n- entrance hall;\n\n- large living room;\n\n- Spacious bathroom;\n\n-kitchen;\n\n- 2 bedrooms, with windows. One of them with built-in wardrobe;\n\n- Terrace and balcony, perfect for outdoor leisure time.\n\nBuilding: Sub-basement, no lift\n\nThis flat has good natural light, something rare in sub-basements, creating a cosy and airy atmosphere. The terrace and balcony offer a private outdoor space, ideal for relaxing or entertaining friends.\n\nThis T2 with generous areas and a functional layout, is suitable for couples, small families or as an investment.\n\nCome and see it! \n\nEnergy Rating: E",
